# NOTE: datasets/text_processing/tokenized_ads.pt is intentionally tracked as a
# ready-to-load handoff artifact (see modeling/README.md). If you'd rather
# regenerate it locally instead, uncomment the next line and `git rm --cached` it:
# datasets/text_processing/tokenized_ads.pt

# Model weights
#
# The tuned classifier IS committed, through Git LFS (see .gitattributes) --
# `git clone` gets working weights with no extra step. It is stored as float16
# (134 MB): float32 would be 268 MB, and changes none of the 485 held-out test
# predictions, so the extra precision is pure clone cost. Run
# `modeling/compress_model.py` after any retrain, before committing.
#
# The baseline model is a scratch experiment and stays out of the repo.
modeling/baseline_distilbert_model/
